🎯 Design Patterns Cheat Sheet

1️⃣ Singleton 👑
"Only ONE of me can exist in this whole app, no clones allowed."
→ Ensures a class has only one instance (like one Database connection, one Logger).

2️⃣ Factory 🏭
"Don't create objects yourself, just tell ME what you want, I'll hand it to you."
→ A method that creates objects for you instead of using new directly, so you don't need to know the exact class.

3️⃣ Observer 👀
"Notify all my subscribers the moment something changes."
→ One object (subject) changes state → all its followers/listeners get auto-notified (like YouTube notifications when your favorite creator uploads 📹).

4️⃣ MVC (Model-View-Controller) 🎬
"Data, Design, and Decisions — each handled by a different guy, no overlap."
→ Model = data/logic, View = what user sees, Controller = middleman who connects both.

🥡 Super simple one-liner to remember all 4:

Singleton = only one boss 👑
Factory = object-making machine 🏭
Observer = gossip network 👀 (everyone gets the tea ☕ instantly)
MVC = teamwork with clear roles 🎬